{"video":"kAVM9Z6dWrI","lines":[{"t":[0,1.3],"en":"What the hell just happened?"},{"t":[1.3,3.3],"en":"I am so, so sorry."},{"t":[3.4,4.7],"en":"I was gonna do it, really."},{"t":[4.9,8.7],"en":"But then I was standing there with $327 in one hand"},{"t":[8.7,11],"en":"and $238 in the other hand,"},{"t":[11,11.9],"en":"and I was thinking, wow,"},{"t":[12.3,13.7],"en":"it's been a long time since I had"},{"t":[13.7,18],"en":"$327 plus $238."},{"t":[20.2,21.6],"en":"Joey, we had a deal."},{"t":[21.8,22.7],"en":"That's why you're here."},{"t":[22.7,23.9],"en":"I've got to fire you."},{"t":[24.1,25.5],"en":"And I've got to pay rent."},{"t":[27.2,29.7],"en":"Look, how about this?"},{"t":[30,31],"en":"You don't fire me."},{"t":[31.1,33.7],"en":"Instead, I stay here, I gain their trust,"},{"t":[33.9,34.8],"en":"and then they'll start listening"},{"t":[34.8,36.9],"en":"to all the nice things I've been saying about you."},{"t":[38.5,39.7],"en":"What kind of things you've been saying?"},{"t":[40.1,40.9],"en":"Well, nothing yet."},{"t":[41,42.4],"en":"They really hate you, and I want to fit in."}]}
